    { "id": "g22-directions", "title": "Beijing directions: 东南西北", "body": "Beijing's streets run north-south and east-west, so locals give directions with compass points: 往东走 (go east), 往南走 (go south). The order is 东南西北.", "examples": ["s22-wangdongnan", "s22-dongnanxibei", "s22-wangxizou"] },
    { "id": "g22-weather", "title": "刮风, 出太阳", "body": "Wind \"blows\": 刮风. The sun \"comes out\": 太阳出来了. Compare 下雨 and 下雪.", "examples": ["s22-chuntianguafeng", "s22-taiyangchulaile"] },
